# Matt Pocock workflow

Before freelancing a parallel process, read and follow the matching skill under `.agents/skills/`:

| Situation | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Ambiguous plan / decision | `/grilling` (or `/grill-with-docs` when docs matter) |
| Spec from idea | `/to-spec` / `/to-questionnaire` |
| Break into tickets | `/to-tickets` |
| Triage / label work | `/triage` |
| Implement from spec | `/implement` or `/implement-spec` |
| Bug diagnosis | `/diagnosing-bugs` |
| TDD feature work | `/tdd` |
| Code review vs standards/spec | `/code-review` |
| Domain language / ADR | `/domain-modeling` |

Issue tracker, triage labels, and domain-doc layout: see `AGENTS.md` → Agent skills and `docs/agents/`.
